    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Infernal Pact Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Constitution or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Devilish Aura.</strong> Your close ties with diabolic powers unsettle others. You can take a Magic action to manifest an aura of fear in a 30-foot Emanation originating from you. Each creature of your choice in it makes a Charisma saving throw (DC 8 plus the modifier of the ability increased by this feat and your Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, it has the Frightened condition until the end of its next turn; on a success, it is unaffected and immune to this aura for 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Devil's Favor.</strong> You can call on your infernal patron for help: when you make a D20 Test, you can add a +2 bonus to the roll. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Diabolic Empowerment.</strong> You always have @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMagicWeapo]{Magic Weapon} prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest; cast this way, its duration becomes 8 hours. You can also cast it with any spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Charisma is your spellcasting ability for this spell.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-GJPUjL1qkJY6dAvB\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The save DC uses Charisma: change it to Constitution in the activity if you increased Constitution. Add the +2 of Devil's Favor to the roll.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
